      <h1 data-i18n="privacy.hero.title">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p data-i18n="privacy.hero.sub">This site collects personal data in one place only: the contact form. Here is exactly what happens to it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal">

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.controller.title">Who is responsible</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.controller.body">Papadopoulos Plastic Profiles S.A. ("pplastic"), 2 Salaminias Str., 11855 Athens, Greece, is the data controller. For anything in this notice, write to pplastic@otenet.gr or call +30 210 3460579.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.what.title">What we collect, and why</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.what.body">If you fill in the contact form we receive your name, email address, an optional phone number, and whatever you write in the message. We use it to answer your enquiry — nothing else. We do not profile you, sell your data, or add you to a mailing list.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.basis.title">Legal basis</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.basis.body">We process the form data on the basis of our legitimate interest in responding to business enquiries, and to take steps at your request before entering into a contract (Article 6(1)(f) and 6(1)(b) GDPR).</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.processors.title">Who else sees it</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.processors.body">The form is delivered by EmailJS, which acts as our processor and may handle the message outside the EEA. Our website host stores standard server logs, which include IP addresses, for security and troubleshooting. No one else receives your data unless the law requires it.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.retention.title">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.retention.body">Enquiry emails stay in our mailbox for as long as the commercial relationship or the enquiry needs, and are deleted when they are no longer useful. Ask us to delete yours sooner and we will.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.cookies.title">Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.cookies.body">This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics or advertising trackers. Fonts are served from our own server rather than a third party, so simply reading these pages sends your details to no one.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.rights.title">Your rights</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.rights.body">You can ask for a copy of the data we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, ask us to restrict or stop processing it, or receive it in a portable format. Email pplastic@otenet.gr and we will respond within one month.</p>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.rights.complaint">If you think we have handled your data badly, you may complain to the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (dpa.gr).</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.changes.title">Changes</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.changes.body">If this notice changes, the revised version appears on this page with a new date below.</p>

        <p class="muted legal-updated" data-i18n="privacy.updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
